 "headline": "Five Magic Missiles killed two Shadows, but they drained his Strength to 3.",
 "prose": [],
 "bullets": [
  {
   "label": "Prep",
   "text": "a GM ruling first: the Strength a Shadow drains stays gone until he finishes a Long Rest (the SRD gives no end)."
  },
  {
   "label": "Scouting",
   "text": "one Shadow failed to hide and was seen at D3; the other stayed hidden in the dark between the pillars."
  },
  {
   "label": "Cheese",
   "text": "Magic Missile never misses, and Shadows resist almost every other kind of damage, so it was missiles every round. A natural 20 in round 3 doubled the darts: 6 of them, killing Shadow A and taking 14 HP off B."
  },
  {
   "label": "The dice",
   "text": "two swipes landed (5 and 4 necrotic dmg), each draining Strength: 8 → 5 → 3. Shield turned the third."
  },
  {
   "label": "Result",
   "text": "11/20 HP, STR 3. At STR 3 he can carry only 20.4 kg, so he leaves the bedroll, the torches, the rope and the crowbar (11 kg) by the door. XP 1,675 → 1,875. +20 GP."
  }
 ],
